 data-tab-title-id=\"e-n-tab-title-296217634\" class=\"e-n-tab-title\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-tab-index=\"4\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"e-n-tab-content-296217634\" style=\"--n-tabs-title-order: 4;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"e-n-tab-title-text\">\n\t\t\t\tRaspberry Pi OS\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t<\/button>\n\t\t\t\t<button id=\"e-n-tab-title-296217635\" data-tab-title-id=\"e-n-tab-title-296217635\" class=\"e-n-tab-title\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-tab-index=\"5\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"e-n-tab-content-296217635\" style=\"--n-tabs-title-order: 5;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"e-n-tab-title-text\">\n\t\t\t\tDocker\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t<\/button>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"e-n-tabs-content\">\n\t\t\t\t<div id=\"e-n-tab-content-296217631\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-tab-title-296217631\" data-tab-index=\"1\" style=\"--n-tabs-title-order: 1;\" class=\"e-active elementor-element elementor-element-235e433 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"235e433\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b9a6780 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"b9a6780\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6d9effe elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6d9effe\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>sudo apt-get update<br>sudo apt-get install -y software-properties-common wget<br>sudo add-apt-repository -y universe<br>wget https:\/\/packages.ntop.org\/apt-stable\/24.04\/all\/apt-ntop-stable.deb<br>sudo apt install -y .\/apt-ntop-stable.deb<br>sudo apt-get update<br>sudo apt-get install -y ntopng<br>sudo systemctl stop ntopng<br>sudo ntopng -i eth1<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div id=\"e-n-tab-content-296217632\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-tab-title-296217632\" data-tab-index=\"2\" style=\"--n-tabs-title-order: 2;\" class=\" elementor-element elementor-element-db1f4d0 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"db1f4d0\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-14d92c7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"14d92c7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><i>Debian 12 bookworm.<\/i><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c793e4a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"c793e4a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ff2651a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ff2651a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>sudo apt-get update<br>sudo apt-get install -y wget<br>sudo sed -i &#039;\/^deb\/ s\/$\/ contrib\/&#039; \/etc\/apt\/sources.list<br>wget https:\/\/packages.ntop.org\/apt-stable\/bookworm\/all\/apt-ntop-stable.deb<br>sudo apt install -y .\/apt-ntop-stable.deb<br>sudo apt-get update<br>sudo apt-get install -y ntopng<br>sudo systemctl stop ntopng<br>sudo ntopng -i eth1<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div id=\"e-n-tab-content-296217633\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-tab-title-296217633\" data-tab-index=\"3\" style=\"--n-tabs-title-order: 3;\" class=\" elementor-element elementor-element-145efd0 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"145efd0\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-846340a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"846340a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><i>Rocky Linux 9 or AlmaLinux 9. On Rocky Linux 10, install redis first from another repository.<\/i><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-10d834f e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"10d834f\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-efbbb12 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"efbbb12\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>curl -s https:\/\/packages.ntop.org\/centos-stable\/ntop.repo | sudo tee \/etc\/yum.repos.d\/ntop.repo &gt; \/dev\/null<br>sudo dnf config-manager &#45;&#45;set-enabled crb<br>sudo dnf install -y epel-release<br>sudo dnf install -y ntopng<br>sudo systemctl stop ntopng<br>sudo ntopng -i eth1<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div id=\"e-n-tab-content-296217634\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-tab-title-296217634\" data-tab-index=\"4\" style=\"--n-tabs-title-order: 4;\" class=\" elementor-element elementor-element-bb8af2a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"bb8af2a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ea58be3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ea58be3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><i>Raspberry Pi OS 64 bit (arm64). Stable and dev use the same packages.<\/i><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-313c940 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"313c940\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f44a818 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f44a818\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>wget https:\/\/packages.ntop.org\/RaspberryPI\/apt-ntop.deb<br>sudo dpkg -i apt-ntop.deb<br>sudo apt-get update<br>sudo apt-get install -y ntopng<br>sudo systemctl stop ntopng<br>sudo ntopng -i eth1<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div id=\"e-n-tab-content-296217635\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-tab-title-296217635\" data-tab-index=\"5\" style=\"--n-tabs-title-order: 5;\" class=\" elementor-element elementor-element-4b7c084 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"4b7c084\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f8a6f57 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f8a6f57\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><i>Needs Docker. Host networking lets the container see your interfaces. Replace eno1 with your interface.<\/i><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8c16390 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"8c16390\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-87a4b06 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"87a4b06\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>docker run -it &#45;&#45;net=host ntop\/ntopng:stable -i eno1<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ee2abd4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ee2abd4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Replace eth1 with your interface name (run ip a).<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fa07fc6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"fa07fc6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Get the traffic to ntopng: a switch mirror port, your firewall (pfSense or OPNsense), or NetFlow from your router.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6cfff8d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6cfff8d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Then open <b>http:\/\/YOUR-IP:3000<\/b> (admin \/ admin) and check Hosts, Flows and Alerts.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a21118e elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"a21118e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Next steps<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1c8b34b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"1c8b34b\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-53f7970 elementor-widget elementor-widget-lte-button\" data-id=\"53f7970\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"lte-button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"lte-btn-wrap\">\r\n\t<a href=\"https:\/\/www.ntop.org\/quickstart\/install-ntopng\/\"  class=\"lte-btn color-hover-default lte-icon-